 ref=\"Ezek 25:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,25,9)\">Ezek 25:9</ref> (figurative, i.e. the side of M. exposed to invasion): <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,7)\">Ezek 29:7</ref>b read probably <bdbheb>כַּף</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sm')\">Sm</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>, compare v<sup>a</sup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of beasts, <ref ref=\"Isa 30:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,6)\">Isa 30:6</ref> (carrying), <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,21)\">Ezek 34:21</ref> (thrusting, in figure), <bdbheb>סֹרָ֑רֶת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 7:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,7,11)\">Zech 7:11</ref> <highlight>a refractory shoulder</highlight> (refusing the yoke, figurative), so <ref ref=\"Neh 9:29\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,29)\">Neh 9:29</ref> of choice meat <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,4)\">Ezek 24:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָרֵךְ</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> = <highlight>shoulder-pieces</highlight> (always plural) of ephod <ref ref=\"Exod 28:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,7)\">Exod 28:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,12)\">Exod 28:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,25)\">Exod 28:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 28:27\" b=\"2\